---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout title="Elixir | Programmable Stellar Accounts">
  <section class="hero">
    <h1>Elixir</h1>
    <p class="subtitle">The programmable account layer for Stellar.</p>
    <div class="cta-group">
      <a href="/docs" class="btn-primary">Get Started</a>
      <a href="/product" class="btn-secondary">View Product</a>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="core-claim">
    <h2>Redefining Signature Rules</h2>
    <p>
      On Stellar, a contract address <em>is</em> an account. 
      Elixir defines what a signature means, moving beyond simple proposal queues to programmable policy.
    </p>
  </section>
</Layout>